: ""}]}], "id": 0, "_data": [{"type": "question", "contents": [{"type": "pdf", "content": "engenn9le12ob04re7pdf01.pdf"}]}]}], "type": "DWS", "id": 11, "_data": [{"type": "instructions", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": " \nListen to a song about promises.\n"}]}, {"type": "group", "contents": [{"type": "group_name", "content": "Take Away"}]}, {"type": "feedback", "content": {"attempt_feedback": [{"type": "text", "content": ""}, {"type": "text", "content": ""}], "correct_feedback": "Correct!", "allowed_attempts": 2, "incorrect_feedback": [{"type": "text", "content": "Whoops! Something important is missing."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Maybe next time..."}]}}, {"type": "learning_skills", "contents": [{"type": "skill", "content": "Reading"}, {"type": "skill", "content": "Listening"}, {"type": "skill", "content": "Writing"}]}, {"type": "post_instructions", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "\nInstructions: Complete the following steps. Fill in the Self Assessment.\n"}]}]}], "type": "scholar", "stimuli": [{"type": "welcome", "contents": [{}], "template_override": 1, "id": 0, "_data": []}, {"contents": [{"type": "slideshow", "value": {"coverimg": "engenn9le12ob04re2img03.jpg", "audiosrc": "engenn9le12ob04re2aud01", "images": [{"time": "0", "image": "engenn9le12ob04re2img03.jpg", "text": "", "id": 0}, {"time": "100", "image": "engenn9le12ob04re2img03.jpg", "text": "Well ... I have to tell you ...  over the years, I've learned about people and promises! Most people just make promises without paying too much attention to what they are saying. I mean ... remember when you were small ... people made lots of promises. I don't know about you, but I believed them all! Did you? Well ... maybe I was much more gullible than you were. I believed everything!", "id": 1}, {"time": "31000", "image": "engenn9le12ob04re2img02.jpg", "text": "\"If you eat your spinach, you'll be strong,\" my grandmother used to say. I ate my spinach zealously ... I was never what you'd call robust.\"If you wear a sweater, you won't catch a cold,\" my mom lovingly intoned all winter. I always wear a sweater. Do you? I always come down with a cold as well!\n<br/><br/>My dad said, \"If you practice enough, you'll become a great basketball player.\" It took me several years to ascertain that practice wasn't a magic formula. I was never going to be a professional basketball player.", "id": 2}, {"time": "73300", "image": "engenn9le12ob04re2img01.jpg", "text": "As an adult, I no longer believe in easy answers. What about you? If you want to convince me of something ... to persuade me with a catchy phrase ... think again.\n<br/><br/>Interestingly enough, despite life's lessons showing me that promises had nothing to do with reality,  I always feel especially good when I have spinach for dinner, put on a warm sweater, or go out into the yard to play a little basketball! That's the honest truth ... I promise!", "id": 3}]}}], "template_override": 1, "title": "", "type": "audio", "id": 1, "_data": []}], "id": 0, "_data": [{"type": "lab_options", "contents": [{"type": "has_nav", "content": true}, {"type": "has_exercise_controls", "content": true}]}]}]}